{"id":"1a814f5220a079de","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-primitive-recursive-program.md","title":"df primitive recursive program","display":"df primitive recursive program","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","aliases":["72-df-primitive-recursive-program"],"display":"df primitive recursive program","depends_on":["[[72-df-recursive-definition]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.1.1, print232/PDF244; explicit local program presentation","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-primitive-recursive-program</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df primitive recursive program"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aeb4dd56db822ff0\" href=\"?note=aeb4dd56db822ff0\" title=\"72-df-recursive-definition\">72-df-recursive-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.1.1, print232/PDF244; explicit local program presentation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>函数多参数记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\">\\(f(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\)</span> 一律表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle)\">\\(f(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle)\\)</span>；一元输入也采用单项元组，零元输入为空元组。元理论为 ZFC。程序是带互不相撞构造子标签的有限树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,i\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m,i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，向量长度是标注的自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c)\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c)\\)</span> 为程序元数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ c⟧:\\omega^{\\operatorname{ar}(c)}\\to\\omega\">\\(⟦ c⟧:\\omega^{\\operatorname{ar}(c)}\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为解释；下式同时按树结构递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\omega\">\\(y\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=m\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}^m\">\\(\\vec d\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}^m\\)</span> 且所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(d_i)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(d_i)=n\\)</span> 时形成；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(d)=n+2\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(d)=n+2\\)</span> 时形成。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P_0&amp;:=\\{Z(n):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{S\\}\\cup\\{P(n,i):i&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal P_{j+1}&amp;:=\\mathcal P_j\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d):n,m\\in\\omega,\\ c\\in\\mathcal P_j,\\ \\vec d\\in\\mathcal P_j^m,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=m,\\ \\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{ar}(d_i)=n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d):n\\in\\omega,\\ c,d\\in\\mathcal P_j,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=n,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(d)=n+2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PRProg}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal P_j,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}(Z(n))&amp;:=n,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(S):=1,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(P(n,i)):=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d))&amp;:=n,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)):=n+1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P_0&amp;:=\\{Z(n):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{S\\}\\cup\\{P(n,i):i&lt;n&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal P_{j+1}&amp;:=\\mathcal P_j\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d):n,m\\in\\omega,\\ c\\in\\mathcal P_j,\\ \\vec d\\in\\mathcal P_j^m,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=m,\\ \\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{ar}(d_i)=n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d):n\\in\\omega,\\ c,d\\in\\mathcal P_j,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=n,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(d)=n+2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PRProg}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal P_j,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}(Z(n))&amp;:=n,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(S):=1,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(P(n,i)):=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d))&amp;:=n,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)):=n+1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ Z(n)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;=0,&amp;⟦ S⟧(x)&amp;=x+1,&amp;⟦ P(n,i)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;=x_i,\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;=⟦ c⟧(⟦ d_0⟧(\\vec x),\\ldots,⟦ d_{m-1}⟧(\\vec x)),\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,0)&amp;=⟦ c⟧(\\vec x),\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,y+1)&amp;=⟦ d⟧(\\vec x,y,⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,y)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ Z(n)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;=0,&amp;⟦ S⟧(x)&amp;=x+1,&amp;⟦ P(n,i)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;=x_i,\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d)⟧(\\vec x)&amp;=⟦ c⟧(⟦ d_0⟧(\\vec x),\\ldots,⟦ d_{m-1}⟧(\\vec x)),\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,0)&amp;=⟦ c⟧(\\vec x),\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,y+1)&amp;=⟦ d⟧(\\vec x,y,⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,y)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PR}_n=\\{⟦ c⟧:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\land\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PR}_n=\\{⟦ c⟧:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\land\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限阶段同时给出程序与元数：新增节点只使用前一阶段已经取得元数的子程序，且外层标签唯一决定输出元数。程序解释继而按有限树与自然数递归给出。这里使用显式 ω 阶段并，不再把最小闭包的含义放在 Remark 中。同一函数可以有多个程序；解释函数与函数图闭包之间通过固定坐标置换对应。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-recursive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"aeb4dd56db822ff0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-definition]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"n,m,i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(c)","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ c⟧:\\omega^{\\operatorname{ar}(c)}\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^n","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(d_i)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(d)=n+2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal P_0&:=\\{Z(n):n\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{S\\}\\cup\\{P(n,i):i<n<\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal P_{j+1}&:=\\mathcal P_j\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d):n,m\\in\\omega,\\ c\\in\\mathcal P_j,\\ \\vec d\\in\\mathcal P_j^m,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=m,\\ \\forall i<m\\ \\operatorname{ar}(d_i)=n\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d):n\\in\\omega,\\ c,d\\in\\mathcal P_j,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(c)=n,\\ \\operatorname{ar}(d)=n+2\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PRProg}&:=\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\mathcal P_j,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}(Z(n))&:=n,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(S):=1,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(P(n,i)):=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ar}(\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d))&:=n,\\quad\\operatorname{ar}(\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)):=n+1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ Z(n)⟧(\\vec x)&=0,&⟦ S⟧(x)&=x+1,&⟦ P(n,i)⟧(\\vec x)&=x_i,\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Comp}(n,m,c,\\vec d)⟧(\\vec x)&=⟦ c⟧(⟦ d_0⟧(\\vec x),\\ldots,⟦ d_{m-1}⟧(\\vec x)),\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,0)&=⟦ c⟧(\\vec x),\\\\\n⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,y+1)&=⟦ d⟧(\\vec x,y,⟦\\operatorname{Rec}(n,c,d)⟧(\\vec x,y)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PR}_n=\\{⟦ c⟧:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\land\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2898,"backlinks":[{"id":"4c14656043bc77c1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"程序、元数、解释取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]。$\\dagger$ 是不属于有限记录集合的非法解码值。下式先定义编码数据集 $\\mathcal C_{\\iota,E}$，再定义带公理证书、逻辑证书和检查程序的集合 $\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)$；$\\kappa=\\langle\\gamma,AC,LC,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)$，$\\gamma=\\langle e,v,\\operatorname{cs},\\operatorname{ds}\\rangle$。投影下标 $\\kappa$ 表示同一元组的相应分量，例如 $e_\\kappa=e$、$c_\\kappa=c$。所有编码器和检查程序都是数据，不由Remark选择。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program|df primitive recursive program]]"},{"id":"33bb5f7820ca84c2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PRProg},Z,S,P,\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{ar},⟦\\cdot⟧$ 取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]，递归参数位于最后。以下全部 $\\mathsf{sans\\ serif}$ 小写程序名仅在本节点局部使用；每次命名均为一个确定的 PR 程序树，不按外延相等合并程序。"},{"id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]] 的每个程序 $c$ 加入数函数符号 $f_c$，元数为 $\\operatorname{ar}(c)$。$\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}$ 是其构造子定义方程的全称闭包：零、后继、投影、复合、递归分别由程序解释的五组方程把 $⟦ c⟧$ 换成 $f_c$ 得到。$E_{\\rm PR}:=\\{f_c:c\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}\\}$。"},{"id":"7fc22c4e13a7c2b8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件的函数符号使用 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]] 的程序标签：$\\mathsf f_c$ 与数常元、集合变量、模板孔及逻辑标签不相交。$\\mathcal I$ 为 Assertion 给出的解释映射，$v$ 只在无模板孔的 $\\mathsf T$ 上求值；含孔项先应用 $\\sigma_{\\vec n}$。"},{"id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-primitive-recursive-program|df primitive recursive program]]"},{"id":"b3c39d743a421f30","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $x:=x_0,p:=x_1$。$\\operatorname{SubCode}:=\\operatorname{SubCode}_{e_\\kappa}$ 为上游明定坏码行为的数码代入函数；$\\operatorname{diag}(a):=\\operatorname{SubCode}(a,a)$。依 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]，固定 $c_\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{PRProg}$，$\\operatorname{ar}(c_\\Delta)=1$、$⟦ c_\\Delta⟧=\\operatorname{diag}$，并记 $f_{\\rm diag}:=f_{c_\\Delta}$。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-primitive-recursive-program|72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"}],"outgoing":["aeb4dd56db822ff0"]}